#+TITLE: Forecast Computation
#+PROPERTY: header-args:racket :results value :eval never-export

* Observation totals
  | Day | Samples |
  |-----+---------|
  | Mon |       3 |
  | Tue |       4 |
  | Wed |       5 |
  |-----+---------|
  | Total |      12 |
  #+TBLFM: @>$2=vsum(@2..@4)

* Safe source block
  This block reads no files, starts no child process, and uses no network.

  #+name: sample-summary
  #+begin_src racket
  (hash 'samples 12 'status 'ready)
  #+end_src

* Expected outcome
  Recalculation changes only the total cell. Formula inspection does not edit
  source. Explicit execution returns a typed value when a Racket adapter and
  deny-first policy are available; otherwise it reports unavailable without
  changing the block or existing results.
